    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The English subtitles were generated using AI translation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some character illustrations have been modified using AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your hometown and manage the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide your restaurant with various ingredients and dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in the deserted town and gradually bring it back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your restaurant into a five-star establishment and revitalize the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill your dream of becoming a chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Farm Management\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow different kinds of vegetables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a variety of animals and fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide your restaurant with a wide range of fresh ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816070/extras/571d302387e3c3deee40c595e4cd5ce2.avif?t=1752589947\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Restaurant Management\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various recipes and serve delicious dishes in your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill customers\u2019 requests,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816070/extras/e4d88ccdf5de6de12719799159bed071.avif?t=1752589947\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit many partners,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And work together to create a five-star restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816070/extras/348599da0ea222402081cb39012b709b.avif?t=1752589947\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Bonding with Residents\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the residents\u2019 requests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and build strong relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through close interactions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you\u2019ll unlock various actions\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and maybe even become an important part of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
